laden-desktop-settings — MIT (intended)
=======================================

Original Laden OS desktop settings (fish configs, look-and-feel, Plasma
defaults). Copyright (c) 2026 Laden AS.

Intended PKGBUILD license: MIT (see LICENSES/MIT.txt).

NOTE: As of the v1 license prep commit, packages/laden-desktop-settings/PKGBUILD
still said license=('LicenseRef-LadenAS') because an editions worker had
uncommitted edits in that file. Update the PKGBUILD to MIT and bump pkgrel
when those editions changes are committed or discarded. LadenDark.colors
inside the assets remains LGPL-2.0-or-later (KDE Breeze lineage).
